                                <strong>SPI Advantages:</strong><br>
                                • Faster data transfer<br>
                                • Full-duplex communication<br>
                                • Simple protocol<br>
                                • No addressing needed
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>I2C Advantages:</strong><br>
                                • Only 2 wires needed<br>
                                • Multiple devices on same bus<br>
                                • Built-in addressing<br>
                                • Less pin usage
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
